## Recommended Mitigation Steps
Override the transferOwnership function to automatically grant the `DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE` to the newOwner and revoke it from the previous owner. This will ensure the new owner has full role management capabilities, avoiding any temporary denial of service (DoS) issues.


